2870	// 解析整个 iCalendar 文件；任何结构错误、关键属性重复或缺失都抛出 BizError（整批失败）
2871	function parseIcalFile(text: string, file: string): IcalEvent[] {
2872	  const bad = (reason: string): never => {
2873	    throw new BizError(`iCalendar 文件 ${file} 无法导入：${reason}（整批未导入，数据未改动）`);
2874	  };
2875	  const lines = unfoldIcalLines(text, bad);
2876	  if (lines.length === 0) bad('文件为空');
2877	
2878	  const events: IcalEvent[] = [];
2879	  const seenUids = new Set<string>();
2880	  let inCalendar = false;
2881	  let calendarEnded = false;
2882	  let versionSeen = false;
2883	  let inEvent = false;
2884	  let curUid: string | undefined;
2885	  let curStart: {raw: string; min: number} | undefined;
2886	  let curEnd: {raw: string; min: number} | undefined;
2887	  let curRrule: string | undefined; // RRULE 原文（至多一条）
2888	  let curExdates: Array<{raw: string; min: number}> = []; // 多行 EXDATE 合并后的候选时间
2889	
2890	  const closeEvent = (): void => {
2891	    if (curUid === undefined) bad('VEVENT 缺少 UID 属性');
2892	    if (curStart === undefined) bad(`VEVENT（UID “${curUid}”）缺少 DTSTART 属性`);
2893	    if (curEnd === undefined) bad(`VEVENT（UID “${curUid}”）缺少 DTEND 属性`);
2894	    if (curEnd.min <= curStart.min) {
2895	      bad(`VEVENT（UID “${curUid}”）结束时间必须晚于开始时间（${curStart.raw} → ${curEnd.raw}），允许跨日`);
2896	    }
2897	    if (seenUids.has(curUid)) bad(`文件内 UID 重复: “${curUid}”（解码后区分大小写）`);
2898	    seenUids.add(curUid);
2899	
2900	    const ev: IcalEvent = {
2901	      uid: curUid,
2902	      startRaw: curStart.raw,
2903	      endRaw: curEnd.raw,
2904	      startMin: curStart.min,
2905	      endMin: curEnd.min,
2906	      recurring: false,
2907	      occurrences: [],
2908	    };
2909	
2910	    // 无规则却有 EXDATE：整批拒绝（排除日期只在按周重复事件中有意义）
2911	    if (curRrule === undefined) {
2912	      if (curExdates.length > 0) bad(`VEVENT（UID “${curUid}”）含 EXDATE 却没有 RRULE（无规则不能带排除日期）`);
2913	      ev.occurrences.push({
2914	        startRaw: curStart.raw,
2915	        endRaw: curEnd.raw,
2916	        startMin: curStart.min,
2917	        endMin: curEnd.min,
2918	      });
2919	    } else {
2920	      const count = parseWeeklyRrule(curRrule, bad);
2921	      ev.recurring = true;
2922	      ev.count = count;
2923	      // EXDATE 只能匹配原开始时间：全部候选必须落在按周展开的原开始时间集合上，
2924	      // 多行与逗号列表合并、按集合去重
2925	      const allStarts = new Map<number, string>();
2926	      for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {
2927	        const sMin = curStart.min + i * 7 * 1440;
2928	        const eMin = curEnd.min + i * 7 * 1440;
2929	        const sRaw = formatDateTime(sMin);
2930	        const eRaw = formatDateTime(eMin);
2931	        if (sRaw === null || eRaw === null) {
2932	          bad(
2933	            `VEVENT（UID “${curUid}”）按周展开第 ${i + 1} 项超出四位年份范围（0001-9999），整批拒绝`,
2934	          );
2935	        }
